      "widgets_values": [
        "A realistic, intimate home photograph of a young adult East Asian woman in her early 20s, lying on her back on a soft rug and white faux-fur blanket. She is captured from a high-angle overhead perspective with a slight diagonal tilt, her body stretching upward in the frame while her bent knees are positioned close to the lens, creating a strong foreground perspective. Her head is near the upper part of the frame, supported by a pink cushion.\nShe has a quiet, gentle, and relaxed expression as if just waking from a nap — half-open sleepy eyes with a soft hazy gaze looking lazily toward the camera, lips naturally slightly parted in a tender, drowsy manner. Her deep brown-black long hair is naturally spread out across the rug and blanket, with some strands falling messily across her cheeks and forehead, catching soft backlit highlights.\nShe is wearing a pale pink and white short-sleeved floral dress with a low round neckline and tiny pink floral prints. The light, soft fabric naturally drapes and wrinkles around her body. Her legs are bent upward, with white mid-calf slouch socks featuring relaxed folds. A small delicate necklace and a slim bracelet on her wrist catch subtle light.\nVisible skin areas include her face, neck, collarbones, upper chest, shoulders, arms, hands, knees, and large portions of her thighs, all rendered with a natural fair warm ivory tone that glows softly in the sunlight and turns slightly cool in shadows. The skin has a delicate, velvety texture with realistic natural variations, not airbrushed.\nStrong natural window sunlight pours in from the upper left, creating bright highlight patches on her forehead, hair, arms, knees, and legs, with gentle overexposure and soft haze, while shadows retain subtle depth and film-like grain. The background consists of a coarse beige woven rug, white faux-fur blanket, pink cushion, scattered books or magazines, and a few pieces of fruit, giving a lived-in, cozy afternoon atmosphere.\nThe overall mood is lazy, soft, private, and intimate — like a quiet, casual moment in warm afternoon light, with a realistic snapshot feel: slight imperfections, natural messiness in the hair and background, medium depth of field, and authentic home photography qualities."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
